  "instruction": "The privileged-administrator review for Adrian Kowalczyk is supposed to happen this week and Maja asked for Thursday. It is a long continuous session with owner confirmation and evidence capture, so I need to know whether Thursday genuinely fits with a Tier-2-qualified responder without displacing the regulator session, and if it does not, the earliest day that does. Confirm the role grants in the register are actually revocable too. Book the pending bridge where it truly fits, and leave a note for Maja with the date, what constrained it, and what the alternatives would have cost or required.",
